cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If figspec helped your research, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "figspec: declarative, publication-ready, reproducible scientific figures"
abstract: >-
  figspec compiles a small YAML description of a figure into journal-compliant
  PDF, SVG and raster output. It bundles journal column grids and minimum type
  sizes, lints figures for legibility and colour-vision accessibility, and
  records a provenance manifest so that a figure can be verified long after it
  was built.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
repository-code: "https://github.com/figspec/figspec"
url: "https://figspec.github.io/figspec/"
keywords:
  - scientific-visualization
  - reproducibility
  - matplotlib
  - publication-figures
authors:
